{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows短时间内大量结束进程或服务。对应需求：影响破坏。官方：High Number of Process and/or Service Terminations。","from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows短时间内大量结束进程或服务","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows短时间内大量结束进程或服务\n\n### 为何重要\n破坏可用性或加密数据\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","references":["https://www.elastic.co/security-labs/luna-ransomware-attack-pattern"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"035889c4-2686-4583-a7df-67f89c292f2c","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 影响破坏","来源: 默认","对应需求: 影响破坏"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"threshold","query":"event.category:process and host.os.type:windows and event.type:start and process.name:(net.exe or sc.exe or taskkill.exe) and\n process.args:(stop or pause or delete or \"/PID\" or \"/IM\" or \"/T\" or \"/F\" or \"/t\" or \"/f\" or \"/im\" or \"/pid\") and\n not process.parent.name:(osquerybeat.exe or agentbeat.exe)\n","threshold":{"field":["host.id"],"value":10},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1489","name":"Service Stop","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1489/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0040","name":"Impact","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0040/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1562","name":"Impair Defenses","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1562/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1562.001","name":"Disable or Modify Tools","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1562/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"system","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":219,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
